      "text": "Skip to content\nAutoPromote.\nFeatures\nProduct Tour\nAI Director\nFor Creators\nPricing\nSign In\nStart Creating\n\nYOUR STORY. EVERY SCREEN.\n\nTurn podcasts into\nViral Clips.Your way.\n\nFind your strongest moments. Bring every angle, clean audio and captions into one edit. Make the final cut yours.\n\nStart Creating\nWatch Demo\n\nStart with a free account. Make the final cut yours.\n\nONE CONVERSATION. EVERY POSSIBILITY.\nMulti-camera\nAuto captions\nAI-assisted edits\nNEW AUDIENCES.\nTHE AUTOPROMOTE EDITING FILM\nReplay film\nPause\n\nIllustrative edit · Social export · Sample podcast footage\n\nStart Creating\nFROM A FULL CONVERSATION TO YOUR NEXT\nTikTok\nYouTube Shorts\nInstagram Reels\n\nSCROLL THROUGH THE MAKING OF A CLIP\n\n01 / 08\nCAMERA SOURCES\nBring every angle.\n\nYour host, your guest, your wider view. One conversation, with room for every perspective.\n\nCamera sources\nClean audio sync\nContent analysis\nDirector suggestions\nBuild the timeline\nClip discovery\nVertical reframe\nSocial export\nStart Creating\nAll your angles. One story.\nCam A\nHost\nCam B\nGuest\nCam C\nWide\nThe conversation · Podcast edit\nAutoPromote Studio\nProgramme preview\nThis is a game changer.\n00:12:08\n16:9\nYour story, in the making\n00:12 / 00:48\n00:00\n00:12\n00:24\n00:36\n00:48\nHook\nViral moment\nKey point\nB-roll\nCTA\nV1\nCC\nThis is a\ngame changer.\nHere’s why.\nA1\nFOLLOW THE CONVERSATION\nActive speaker detected\nCam A · Host\nAI CLIP FINDER\nA moment worth sharing\nSuggested clip · ready to review\n9:16\nMake every\nmoment count.\nTikTok\n9:16\nMake every\nmoment count.\nYouTube Shorts\n9:16\nMake every\nmoment count.\nInstagram Reels\nClean audio synced\nCaptions drafted\nSCROLL TO DIRECT THE EDIT\nPause\n\nIllustrative edit · Camera sources · Sample podcast footage\n\nMADE FOR THE EDIT\n\nLess busywork.\nMore creative control.\n\nFrom the first camera angle to the final caption.\nEverything your next video needs, in one creative workflow.\n\nCam A\nHost\nCam B\nGuest\nCam C\nWide\nEVERY ANGLE, IN SYNC\nMulti-Camera Editing\n\nBring your camera angles together. Detect active speakers and use automatic camera switches or make the cut yourself.\n\nCLIP 01\nThe opening hook\nHook\nCLIP 02\nA new perspective\nKey point\nCLIP 03\nThe takeaway\nStory\nTHE MOMENTS THAT MATTER\nAI Viral Clip Finder\n\nFind and rank promising moments in your long-form videos. Review the candidates and choose what makes the cut.\n\nEnglish\nisiXhosa\n\nYour story.\nYour voice.\n\n Draft. Review. Make it yours.\nLET EVERY WORD LAND\nAuto Captions\n\nGenerate caption drafts in English or isiXhosa. Review the words, refine the styling, and keep your voice in the edit.\n\nCamera audio\nExternal audio\n Aligned\nSOUND AS GOOD AS YOU LOOK\nExternal Audio Sync\n\nUse your clean recorder audio as the master track. Align it with your cameras and keep the conversation in sync.\n\nPROJECT-AWARE SUGGESTION\nSplit at the next moment\nReview\nTighten the opening\nReview\n\nYour approval. Your timeline.\n\nA SECOND CREATIVE PERSPECTIVE\nAI Director\n\nReview project-aware split and trim suggestions. You decide which proposed edits belong in your timeline.\n\n9:16\nMake every\nmoment count.\nTikTok\n9:16\nMake every\nmoment count.\nYouTube Shorts\n9:16\nMake every\nmoment count.\nInstagram Reels\n9:16\n1:1\n16:9\nONE STORY. EVERY FORMAT.\nSocial Export\n\nReframe for vertical and square video, add captions, and prepare your edit for TikTok, YouTube Shorts and Instagram Reels.\n\nMulti-camera and premium creative tools are available on paid plans. Analysis, audio sync and server exports use credits.\n\nMEET YOUR AI DIRECTOR\n\nCreative support.\nCreator in control.\n\nA second perspective on your project. Review split and trim suggestions, see what will change, and approve the edits that serve your story.\n\n Every proposed edit starts with your review.\n\nSee the creative workflow\nPROJECT CONTEXT\nDialogue\nShots\nSpeakers\nAudio\nMoments\nCaptions\nAI Director\nUnderstand. Suggest. Review.\nPROPOSED EDITS\nFor your review\n\nSplit at a chosen moment\nReview\n\nTrim the clip edges\nReview\n\nCONTINUE IN THE EDITOR\n\nReframe · Caption · B-roll · Zoom · Music · Social version\n\nYour tools. Your creative decisions.\n\nTHE AUTOPROMOTE FLOW\n\nMake it yours.\nThen make it seen.\n\nFrom the first upload to your next release.\nSee the real workspace, one chapter at a time.\n\nAUTOPROMOTE / IN ACTION\n01 — 04 / 00:36\nPlay product tour\nFour pages. One creative flow.\n01\nUploads\nBring in your footage. Choose where the story goes.\n02\nStudio\nPlay it back. Make the cut. Keep creative control.\n03\nSchedule\nSee what is queued and plan your next release.\n04\nAnalytics\nExplore views, clicks and performance by platform.\nRecorded in AutoPromote · Sample workspace and metrics\nOpen film ↗\n\nFOR THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE CAMERA\n\nYou bring the story.\nWe bring the tools.\n\nFor the conversations, ideas and perspectives\nthat deserve to get out into the world.\n\n01 / MADE FOR YOU\nPodcasters\n\nKeep the conversation. Lose the editing marathon.\n\n02 / MADE FOR YOU\nInterviews & conversations\n\nGive every angle and every voice its moment.\n\n03 / MADE FOR YOU\nSocial-first creators\n\nTurn a longer story into your next short-form cut.\n\nTHE NEXT GREAT CLIP IS IN YOUR FOOTAGE.\n\nLet’s make it happen.\n\nYour perspective. Your voice. Your next creation.\n\nStart Creating\nFree account to start · Paid creative tools and credit-based exports\nAutoPromote.\n\nAI video editing.\nMade for your next great story.\n\nPRODUCT\nFeatures\nPricing\nDocumentation\nAUTOPROMOTE\nAbout\nContact\nHelp Center\nMADE TO CREATE.\n\nFrom a conversation\nto a connection.\n\n© 2026 AutoPromote. All rights reserved.\nPrivacy\nTerms\nAccessibility\n\nREAL AUTOPROMOTE FOOTAGE\n\nYour footage. Your edit. Your next release.\nPlay product tour\nFour pages. One creative flow.\n01\nUploads\nBring in your footage. Choose where the story goes.\n02\nStudio\nPlay it back. Make the cut. Keep creative control.\n03\nSchedule\nSee what is queued and plan your next release.\n04\nAnalytics\nExplore views, clicks and performance by platform.\nRecorded in AutoPromote · Sample workspace and metrics\nOpen film ↗",
